  "slug": "cleaning-service-warranty-request-form",
  "title": "Cleaning Service Warranty Request Form",
  "subtitle": "Control site preparation, cleaning, disinfection, inspection, and secure handoff through verified identity, domain-specific observations, evidence, authorization, exception ownership, and accountable closeout.",
  "description": "An original, workflow-complete cleaning service warranty request for rooms, surfaces, fixtures, chemicals, tools, and controlled items. It connects cleaning plan, product label, safety data, and site instructions to present conditions, repeatable evidence, decisions, unresolved work, and the receiving party's handoff.",
  "use_case": "Use when a cleaning-service coordinator must investigate a cleaning service warranty or callback without treating the request as a coverage decision before identity, chronology, condition, and evidence are reviewed.",
  "risk_tier": "A",
